  "notes": "Each precinct has one 'Member of Republican County Committee' contest; the number of seats (vote for not more than N) varies by precinct from 1 to 6, so seats_per_precinct = 2 is only the most common value. The county site lists 55 precincts (counties.geojson lists 54). as_of is the date the official results page was read; the page carries no publication date. Status rules: filed candidate with votes inside the top N = filled (unknown on a boundary tie or if write-ins exceeded a lone candidate); open seats beyond the filed candidates are unknown when write-in votes were cast (write-ins are not itemized) and empty when none were. Holder names come from the official results export: on each seat already counted as filled, the winning ballot candidate as printed (named write-ins are never used)."
